---
import { withBase } from '../lib/paths';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Website terms"
  description="Terms for using this website, its writing and project material."
  ><div class="wrap legal-page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <div class="eyebrow">ExoSquare</div><h1>Website terms</h1><p>
        Terms for using this website, its writing and project material.
      </p><p class="legal-date">Last updated 7 September 2026</p>
    </header><section class="editorial-grid contact-section">
      <h2>About these terms</h2><div class="prose">
        <p>
          These terms describe the permitted use of the ExoSquare website and
          its content. “ExoSquare”, “we”, “us” and “our” refer collectively to
          Exosquare Limited in Hong Kong (business registration number 75803217)
          and Exosquare Pty. Ltd. in Australia (ACN 621 091 254), as relevant to
          the activity concerned.
        </p><p>
          These terms concern website use. Any commissioned work, separately
          supplied service or licensed software is subject to its own agreed
          terms or licence. This website does not itself provide an account,
          subscription or purchasing service.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="editorial-grid contact-section">
      <h2>Information and experiments</h2><div class="prose">
        <p>
          The website shares writing, project records and experimental work.
          Content is provided for general information and may describe work in
          progress, provisional findings or approaches that are not suitable for
          every situation. Read a project’s status, evidence and stated
          limitations alongside its results.
        </p><p>
