          experiment will deliver a particular result. You should assess its
          suitability for your circumstances and obtain appropriate advice
          before relying on it for consequential decisions.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="editorial-grid contact-section">
      <h2>Responsible use</h2><div class="prose">
        <p>
          You may browse the website and share links to its public pages. Use it
          lawfully and respect the rights of others. You must not attempt
          unauthorised access, introduce malicious code, interfere with the
          website’s operation or use its content to misrepresent an affiliation
          with ExoSquare.
        </p><p>
          Automated access must not place an unreasonable load on the website or
          bypass access restrictions. Where a feed is available, use it in a way
          that respects these requirements and any applicable content licence.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="editorial-grid contact-section">
      <h2>Copyright and project licences</h2><div class="prose">
        <p>
          Rights in the website’s writing, design and other material remain with
          their respective owners. Publication does not transfer ownership or
          grant a general right to republish, adapt or commercially exploit that
          material.
        </p><p>
          You may view the site and make copies needed for ordinary browsing.
          Any further use must be permitted by applicable law, an express
          licence or the relevant rights holder. Preserve applicable attribution
          and notices when reusing material.
        </p><p>
          Some projects, code or assets have separate licences. Those licences
          govern the material they cover and take precedence over these terms
          for that use. A licence for one project does not apply automatically
          to the rest of the website. Contact <a
            href="mailto:hello@exosquare.com">hello@exosquare.com</a
          > if permission or licence scope is unclear.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="editorial-grid contact-section">
      <h2>External links</h2><div class="prose">
        <p>
          Links and QR codes may take you to independent websites, repositories
          or applications. We do not control their content, availability or
          practices. A link does not, by itself, imply endorsement or a business
          relationship. Review the destination’s terms and privacy information
          before using it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="editorial-grid contact-section">
      <h2>Accuracy and availability</h2><div class="prose">
        <p>
          We aim to present information accurately, but content may contain
          errors or become out of date. We may correct, update or remove content
          and change or suspend parts of the website. We do not promise
          uninterrupted access or that every item is complete, current or free
