        </p><p>
          Please report an error or rights concern to <a
            href="mailto:hello@exosquare.com">hello@exosquare.com</a
          >, identifying the page and relevant details.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="editorial-grid contact-section">
      <h2>Legal rights and responsibility</h2><div class="prose">
        <p>
          Nothing in these terms excludes, restricts or modifies a right,
