          not responsible for indirect or consequential loss arising from use
          of, or inability to use, the website. This provision does not exclude
          liability that applicable law requires us to retain.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="editorial-grid contact-section">
      <h2>Privacy, changes and contact</h2><div class="prose">
        <p>
          Our <a href={withBase("/privacy/")}>privacy policy</a> explains how we handle personal
